Greetings,
 I am toying with the idea of using a JFS for a large
 filesystem, to reduce the bootup times in the event of
 a crash. I have looked at few of them, GFS (global file
 system) looks attractive. 
 My question is, what has been the experience of folks 
 in the list who are using JFS in production use. Since
 all of them seem to be in some form of beta, are they 
 reliable? Would definitely love to hear the pro and cons
 of each?
 Cheers
 Thanks
 Mohan





