On Fri, Jan 26, 2001 at 10:27:35AM +0000, Nelson Brito wrote:
> > make zImage (or make bzImage)
> 
> make vmlinux
> it will work :-)

Indeed, but it will not do really what you want.  'make boot' does a few
important things more. 

BTW - 'make boot' works across all architectures although on x86 is
equivalent to 'make zImage' (look at architecture specific files in
'boot' subdirectories) and the later is rarely good enough on x86 due to
BIOS limitations there so 'make bzImage' is needed.

  Michal




